    "description": "MLX is an array framework for machine learning on Apple silicon. MLX is\ndesigned by machine learning researchers for machine learning\nresearchers. The framework is intended to be user-friendly, but still\nefficient to train and deploy models. It provides familiar NumPy-like\nAPIs and supports composable function transformations for automatic\ndifferentiation, automatic vectorization, and computation graph\noptimization.\n",
